The following notation is used throughout the paper:

Ci—the worst-case execution time of task τᵢ;  
Di—the relative deadline of task τᵢ;  
Ti—the period of task τᵢ;  
n—the number of tasks in the system or the task set;  
di—absolute deadline of a job for task τᵢ;  
Ui—the utilization of task τᵢ, and Ui = Ci/Ti;  
U—the total utilization of the task set, computed by

